  <p class="sub">Ractors, Fibers, and how far can we stretch it.</p>
  <div class="meta"><span>ruby 4.1.0dev master 9b8b0ae443</span><span>go1.25.5</span><span>Ryzen 7 9800X3D, 8 cores, 16 threads</span><span>3 October 2026</span></div>
